xSMSDaemon is built by build_scripts\msw\build_xSchedule_x64.cmd along with xSchedule.

To build it in Visual Studio, run that script once (or xlights\ci_scripts\fetch_dependencies.ps1 -Only Dependencies)
to stage the xLights dependency bundle, then open xSMSDaemon.sln and build Release x64. It needs the VS 2026 (v145)
toolset.

The plugin links its own static copy of wxWidgets from the bundle, so it runs alongside xSchedule's.
